   "picker after the late plan",
   "\n    <div class=\"between\"><p class=\"muted small\">Currently on <b>a</b>. Pick a host for a full capacity review. These initial estimates are not an admission check.</p>\n      <button class=\"btn pri sm\" onclick=\"pickMove(\"&lt;new&gt;\")\">Best fit · &lt;new&gt;</button></div>\n    <div class=\"constraintbar\"><span class=\"dim small\">No host-specific hardware requirements.</span></div>\n    \n\n    <div class=\"movegrid\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">\n      <div class=\"movecard cur \"\n              data-node=\"a\">\n          <div class=\"between\">\n            <div class=\"row\" style=\"gap:9px\">\n              <div class=\"av n2\">A</div>\n              <div><div style=\"font-weight:670\">a</div>\n                <div class=\"dim xs\">1 of your pods · score 1</div></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"ui-chip neutral\">current</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"margin-top:12px\">\n            <div class=\"between\"><span class=\"dim xs\">Preliminary CPU estimate</span>\n              <span class=\"mono small\">1%</span></div>\n            \n            <div class=\"between\"><span class=\"dim xs\">Preliminary RAM estimate</span>\n              <span class=\"mono small\">1%</span></div>\n            \n          </div>\n          <div style=\"margin-top:11px\">\n             \n             \n             \n          </div>\n        </div><div class=\"movecard  \"\n             onclick=\"pickMove(\"&lt;new&gt;\")\" data-node=\"&lt;new&gt;\">\n          <div class=\"between\">\n            <div class=\"row\" style=\"gap:9px\">\n              <div class=\"av n2\">EW</div>\n              <div><div style=\"font-weight:670\">&lt;new&gt;</div>\n                <div class=\"dim xs\">0 of your pods · score 2</div></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"ui-chip neutral\">review needed</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"margin-top:12px\">\n            <div class=\"between\"><span class=\"dim xs\">Preliminary CPU estimate</span>\n              <span class=\"mono small\">2%</span></div>\n            \n            <div class=\"between\"><span class=\"dim xs\">Preliminary RAM estimate</span>\n              <span class=\"mono small\">2%</span></div>\n            \n          </div>\n          <div style=\"margin-top:11px\">\n             \n             \n             \n          </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><label class=\"switch\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"mv_unpin\">\n      Clear preference — let the scheduler choose</label>\n      <label class=\"switch\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"mv_pin\"> Hard pin </label></div>\n\n    <div class=\"ui-actions\" >\n      <div class=\"ui-actions-start\"><button data-dialog-dismiss=\"true\" class=\"btn\" onclick=\"modalBack()\">Cancel</button></div><div class=\"ui-actions-end\"><button class=\"btn pri\" id=\"mv_go\" onclick=\"doMoveNow(\"lab\",\"app\")\" disabled>Review move</button>\n      </div></div>\n    <div class=\"note\" style=\"margin-top:14px\">Expect downtime: the old pod must stop before its ReadWriteOnce volume can attach elsewhere. Termination or reattachment may fail. </div>"
